<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SENATE ELECTIONS RESULTS -- ALL DECLARED.</title>
<headline>CZECH SENATE ELECTIONS RESULTS -- ALL DECLARED.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are preliminary</p>
<p>results after the second round run-off in elections to the new</p>
<p>Czech Senate on Friday and Saturday with all 81 constituencies</p>
<p>declared.</p>
<p>		     WON IN	    WON IN	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		    2ND ROUND	 1ST ROUND</p>
<p>    ODS		29		   3	     32</p>
<p>    CSSD	     25		   0	     25</p>
<p>    KDU-CSL	  12		   1	     13</p>
<p>    KSCM		2		   0		2</p>
<p>    ODA		 7		   0		7</p>
<p>    OTHERS	    2		   0		2</p>
<p>These figures are from the Central Election Commission</p>
<p>(UVK). The parties listed are:</p>
<p>ODS: Civic Democratic Party</p>
<p>CSSD: Czech Social Democratic Party</p>
<p>KDU-CSL: Christian Democratic Union-Czechoslovak People's</p>
<p>Party</p>
<p>KSCM: Communist Party of Bohemia and Moravia</p>
<p>ODA: Civic Democratic Alliance.</p>
<p>The run-offs are in 77 of the Senate's 81 constituencies</p>
<p>where no one won more than half the vote in the first round.</p>
<p>They are between the first round winner and runner-up.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
